Description: YouTube Music Player for Debian
 DebTube is a simple, lightweight YouTube music player for Debian 12+.
 It allows you to search, play, and save music from YouTube and YouTube Music.
 .
 Features:
  * Search for music, videos, and playlists
  * Play audio streams with play/pause/stop/next/previous controls
  * Create, save, and load playlists locally
  * Import public playlists from YouTube users/channels
  * Modern PyQt6-based GUI with dark theme
  * Display thumbnails, titles, durations, view counts, and more
